<title>USA: Apogee Enterprises completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Apogee Enterprises completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apogee Enterprises Inc said Thursday its Harmon AutoGlass subsidiary completed the acquisition of  Portland Glass.</p>
<p>As previously noted, the acquisition does not include Portland's replacement window and commercial construction divisions, which will continue to operate under their existing management and ownership.</p>
<p>The transaction includes 46 auto glass shops in five states of the Northeast. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Apogee Enterprises fabricates, distributes and installs glass products and systems.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
